Parked Games (8게임즈) — Korean edition in jaimeen77-cmyk/apps

Source: jaimeen77-cmyk/idrive7games_fork (commit 5c6ac210301822ec9108610e0c95013ba5136369), itself built on the
MGU App Kit of cauliflowermossgrape/idrive7-apps. Parked Games (apps/parked_games) is copyright Maksim
(GitHub: MaxxxFoka); the kit is copyright cauliflowermossgrape and its contributors. Both are under the MIT
licence below, which this edition keeps.

Changes in this edition (jaimeen77-cmyk, 2026): Korean translation of every on-screen text (app.json
translations.ko, merged into the kit's Korean catalog when tools/prepare-games.py prepares the template); the
texts the games drew untranslated (literal: true) now go through the kit's translation; app.json store fields
(mguHmi, supportedLanguages, storeSourceDirs). The games themselves are unchanged.

Fonts in the package keep their own licences beside them: the Ubuntu Font Licence 1.0 (kit/fonts/UFL-Ubuntu.txt)
and the SIL Open Font Licence 1.1 (kit/fonts/OFL-NotoSansKR.txt, OFL-NotoSansSC.txt).

Not in this package: the GPU renderer (idrive7-renderd, GPL-3.0-or-later, mgu-render by Robert Nisipeanu and
IterioDev) and the controller gate (mgu-inputgate). They are separate programs the MGU Store installs from the
source that offers them; this app only talks to them.

BMW, iDrive and the BMW logo are trademarks of BMW AG, used only to say which cars this runs on.

